      "rawSource": "\n\u0026i = 1\nFor \u0026Column in \u0026ColumnsSelector.Columns\n\tIf \u0026Column.ColumnName = \u0026ColumnName\n\t\tExit\n\tEndIf\n\t\u0026i \u002B= 1\nEndFor\n\nIf \u0026i \u003C= \u0026ColumnsSelector.Columns.Count\n\t\u0026ColumnsSelector.Columns.Remove(\u0026i)\nEndIf\n",
